  m_Text: "Hand Tracking Simulation Instructions\r\n\r\nMove Camera: <color=#B086FF>W,
    A, S, D</color>\r\nRotate Camera: Move Mouse While Holding <color=#B086FF>Space
    Bar</color>\r\nSimulated Hand: Move Mouse While Holding <color=#B086FF>Left Shift</color>\r\nMove
    Hand Forward / Backward: <color=#B086FF>Left Shift</color>\u200B + <color=#B086FF>Mouse
    Scroll Wheel</color>\u200B\r\nGesture[Grab] / Pinch / Select: <color=#B086FF>Left
    Shift</color> + <color=#B086FF>Left Mouse Button</color>\r\nGesture[Point]: <color=#B086FF>Left
    Shift</color> + <color=#B086FF>Right Mouse Button</color>\r\nGesture[Open Hand]:
    <color=#B086FF>Left Shift</color> + <color=#B086FF>No Mouse Buttons</color>\r\nSystemGesture:
    <color=#B086FF>Left Shift</color> + <color=#B086FF>Middle Mouse Button</color>"
